-> Covering index range scan on t3 using a over (2 <= a <= 5)  (cost=*** rows=***)

explain format=tree SELECT * FROM t3 WHERE a BETWEEN 2 AND "5";
EXPLAIN
-> Covering index range scan on t3 using a over (2 <= a <= 5)  (cost=*** rows=***)

